{"id":"2e52be0823d13120","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/821_Product_Logic_Π.md","title":"821 Product Logic Π","display":"821_Product_Logic_Π","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。Product Logic 使用构造子：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bot,\\quad \\&amp;,\\quad \\to,\\quad \\wedge,\\quad \\vee.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bot,\\quad \\&amp;,\\quad \\to,\\quad \\wedge,\\quad \\vee.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi},\n\\quad \\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{fus},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{meet},\\operatorname{join}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}^2\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi},\n\\quad \\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{fus},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{meet},\\operatorname{join}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}^2\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A:=A\\to\\bot\">\\(\\neg A:=A\\to\\bot\\)</span>。真值载体与指定值集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf V_{\\Pi}=[0,1],\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf D_{\\Pi}=\\{1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf V_{\\Pi}=[0,1],\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf D_{\\Pi}=\\{1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}\\)</span> 是最小集合，满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{fus}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{fus}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{meet}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{meet}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{join}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{join}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"3.-变元出现与替换\">3. 变元出现与替换</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Pi}\">\\(\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Pi}\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Pi}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Pi}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Pi}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Pi}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Pi}(\\operatorname{fus}(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Pi}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Pi}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Pi}(\\operatorname{fus}(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Pi}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Pi}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Pi}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Pi}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Pi}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Pi}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Pi}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Pi}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Pi}(\\operatorname{meet}(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Pi}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Pi}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Pi}(\\operatorname{meet}(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Pi}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Pi}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Pi}(\\operatorname{join}(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Pi}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Pi}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Pi}(\\operatorname{join}(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Pi}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Pi}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\Pi}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\Pi}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\Pi}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\Pi}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\Pi}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\Pi}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\Pi}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\Pi}\\)</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A)=\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\Pi}(\\sigma,A)\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma(A)=\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\Pi}(\\sigma,A)\\)</span>。其子句为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{fus}(A,B))=\\operatorname{fus}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{fus}(A,B))=\\operatorname{fus}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\operatorname{imp}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\operatorname{imp}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{meet}(A,B))=\\operatorname{meet}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{meet}(A,B))=\\operatorname{meet}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{join}(A,B))=\\operatorname{join}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{join}(A,B))=\\operatorname{join}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义自由变量别名与替换函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\Pi}=\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Pi},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\Pi}=\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Pi},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\Pi}(A,\\sigma)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\Pi}(A,\\sigma)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>绑定排除条款：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{\\Pi}(A)=\\varnothing\n\\quad(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{\\Pi}(A)=\\varnothing\n\\quad(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\Pi}B\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\nA=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\Pi}B\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\nA=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此本语言不需要 fresh 名称、捕获避免重命名或绑定变量替换；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma\\)</span> 是该命题语言的全部结构作用。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"4.-Product-标准代数\">4. Product 标准代数</h1>\n<p>定义运算类型：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_{\\Pi},I_{\\Pi},M_{\\Pi},J_{\\Pi}:\\mathsf V_{\\Pi}^2\\to\\mathsf V_{\\Pi},\n\\qquad\nN_{\\Pi}:\\mathsf V_{\\Pi}\\to\\mathsf V_{\\Pi}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_{\\Pi},I_{\\Pi},M_{\\Pi},J_{\\Pi}:\\mathsf V_{\\Pi}^2\\to\\mathsf V_{\\Pi},\n\\qquad\nN_{\\Pi}:\\mathsf V_{\\Pi}\\to\\mathsf V_{\\Pi}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其值为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_{\\Pi}(a,b)=ab,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_{\\Pi}(a,b)=ab,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I_{\\Pi}(a,b)=\n\\begin{cases}\n1,&amp;a\\le b,\\\\\n\\frac ba,&amp;a&gt;b,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I_{\\Pi}(a,b)=\n\\begin{cases}\n1,&amp;a\\le b,\\\\\n\\frac ba,&amp;a&gt;b,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M_{\\Pi}(a,b)=\\min(a,b),\n\\quad\nJ_{\\Pi}(a,b)=\\max(a,b).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M_{\\Pi}(a,b)=\\min(a,b),\n\\quad\nJ_{\\Pi}(a,b)=\\max(a,b).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>派生否定的真值函数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"N_{\\Pi}(a)=I_{\\Pi}(a,0)=\n\\begin{cases}\n1,&amp;a=0,\\\\\n0,&amp;a&gt;0.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[N_{\\Pi}(a)=I_{\\Pi}(a,0)=\n\\begin{cases}\n1,&amp;a=0,\\\\\n0,&amp;a&gt;0.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>目标差异是融合运算为普通乘法，而不是 Gödel 的最小值或 Łukasiewicz 的截断和。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"5.-赋值递归\">5. 赋值递归</h1>\n<p>赋值集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Val}_{\\Pi}=\\{v:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf V_{\\Pi}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Val}_{\\Pi}=\\{v:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf V_{\\Pi}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{\\Pi}\">\\(v\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{\\Pi}\\)</span>，定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\operatorname{atom}(p)⟧_v^{\\Pi}=v(p),\n\\quad\n⟦\\operatorname{bot}⟧_v^{\\Pi}=0,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\operatorname{atom}(p)⟧_v^{\\Pi}=v(p),\n\\quad\n⟦\\operatorname{bot}⟧_v^{\\Pi}=0,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\operatorname{fus}(A,B)⟧_v^{\\Pi}\n=T_{\\Pi}(⟦ A⟧_v^{\\Pi},⟦ B⟧_v^{\\Pi}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\operatorname{fus}(A,B)⟧_v^{\\Pi}\n=T_{\\Pi}(⟦ A⟧_v^{\\Pi},⟦ B⟧_v^{\\Pi}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)⟧_v^{\\Pi}\n=I_{\\Pi}(⟦ A⟧_v^{\\Pi},⟦ B⟧_v^{\\Pi}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)⟧_v^{\\Pi}\n=I_{\\Pi}(⟦ A⟧_v^{\\Pi},⟦ B⟧_v^{\\Pi}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\operatorname{meet}(A,B)⟧_v^{\\Pi}\n=M_{\\Pi}(⟦ A⟧_v^{\\Pi},⟦ B⟧_v^{\\Pi}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\operatorname{meet}(A,B)⟧_v^{\\Pi}\n=M_{\\Pi}(⟦ A⟧_v^{\\Pi},⟦ B⟧_v^{\\Pi}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\operatorname{join}(A,B)⟧_v^{\\Pi}\n=J_{\\Pi}(⟦ A⟧_v^{\\Pi},⟦ B⟧_v^{\\Pi}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\operatorname{join}(A,B)⟧_v^{\\Pi}\n=J_{\\Pi}(⟦ A⟧_v^{\\Pi},⟦ B⟧_v^{\\Pi}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"6.-语义有效集合与后承\">6. 语义有效集合与后承</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\Pi}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}:\n\\forall v:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to[0,1]\\,\n⟦ A⟧_v^{\\Pi}=1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\Pi}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}:\n\\forall v:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to[0,1]\\,\n⟦ A⟧_v^{\\Pi}=1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义主后承关系</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\Pi}\n\\ \\subseteq\\\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\models_{\\Pi}\n\\ \\subseteq\\\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}\\)</span>，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{\\Pi}A\">\\(\\Gamma\\models_{\\Pi}A\\)</span> 当且仅当对所有\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf V_{\\Pi}\">\\(v:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf V_{\\Pi}\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\forall C\\in\\Gamma\\,⟦ C⟧_v^{\\Pi}=1\\bigr)\n\\Rightarrow\n⟦ A⟧_v^{\\Pi}=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\forall C\\in\\Gamma\\,⟦ C⟧_v^{\\Pi}=1\\bigr)\n\\Rightarrow\n⟦ A⟧_v^{\\Pi}=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"7.-反例证书\">7. 反例证书</h1>\n<p>定义反例证书集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\Pi}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma,A,v):\n\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi},\\\nA\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi},\\\nv:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to[0,1],\\\n\\forall C\\in\\Gamma\\ ⟦ C⟧_v^{\\Pi}=1,\\\n⟦ A⟧_v^{\\Pi}\\ne1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\Pi}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma,A,v):\n\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi},\\\nA\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi},\\\nv:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to[0,1],\\\n\\forall C\\in\\Gamma\\ ⟦ C⟧_v^{\\Pi}=1,\\\n⟦ A⟧_v^{\\Pi}\\ne1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fail}_{\\Pi}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\\{v:(\\Gamma,A,v)\\in\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\Pi}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{\\Pi}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\star\\},&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{\\Pi}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{\\Pi}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Fail}_{\\Pi}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\\{v:(\\Gamma,A,v)\\in\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\Pi}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{\\Pi}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\star\\},&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{\\Pi}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{\\Pi}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>形式证明规则关系声明为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{\\Pi}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi},\n\\qquad \\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{\\Pi}=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{\\Pi}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi},\n\\qquad \\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{\\Pi}=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"8.-整个形式系统\">8. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>Product Logic 为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\Pi}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Pi},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\Pi},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\Pi},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\Pi},\n\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\Pi},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\Pi},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\Pi},\n\\mathsf V_{\\Pi},\n\\mathsf D_{\\Pi},\nT_{\\Pi},\nI_{\\Pi},\nM_{\\Pi},\nJ_{\\Pi},\nN_{\\Pi},\n\\mathsf{Val}_{\\Pi},\n⟦-⟧^{\\Pi},\n\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\Pi},\n\\models_{\\Pi},\n\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\Pi},\n\\mathsf{Fail}_{\\Pi},\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{\\Pi},\n\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{\\Pi}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\Pi}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Pi},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\Pi},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\Pi},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\Pi},\n\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\Pi},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\Pi},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\Pi},\n\\mathsf V_{\\Pi},\n\\mathsf D_{\\Pi},\nT_{\\Pi},\nI_{\\Pi},\nM_{\\Pi},\nJ_{\\Pi},\nN_{\\Pi},\n\\mathsf{Val}_{\\Pi},\n⟦-⟧^{\\Pi},\n\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\Pi},\n\\models_{\\Pi},\n\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\Pi},\n\\mathsf{Fail}_{\\Pi},\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{\\Pi},\n\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{\\Pi}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显式性约束：语义有效集合与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\Pi}\">\\(\\models_{\\Pi}\\)</span> 均由本文件的 Product 真值运算、赋值递归和反例证书定义；不引用外部公式类、命名代数类、基逻辑或未展开的公理表。</p>\n<p>该系统只含命题句法、命题替换、乘积真值代数、语义有效集合和后承关系；不含其他 t-范数语义或证明论对象。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-变元出现与替换","text":"3. 变元出现与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-Product-标准代数","text":"4. Product 标准代数","level":1},{"id":"5.-赋值递归","text":"5. 赋值递归","level":1},{"id":"6.-语义有效集合与后承","text":"6. 语义有效集合与后承","level":1},{"id":"7.-反例证书","text":"7. 反例证书","level":1},{"id":"8.-整个形式系统","text":"8. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot,\\quad \\&,\\quad \\to,\\quad \\wedge,\\quad \\vee.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi},\n\\quad \\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{fus},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{meet},\\operatorname{join}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}^2\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg A:=A\\to\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf V_{\\Pi}=[0,1],\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf D_{\\Pi}=\\{1\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}.","display":true},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{fus}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}.","display":true},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}.","display":true},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{meet}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}.","display":true},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{join}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\Pi}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Pi}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Pi}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Pi}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\